{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBARK ON THE ULTIMATE CAT-ASTROPHE</strong></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <strong>Polo</strong>, a <strong>brave cat abducted by mysterious forces</strong>! Travel across <strong>exotic planets</strong>, face <strong>alien enemies</strong>, and <strong>uncover the truth behind your abduction</strong>. Each <strong>run</strong> is a new journey where you must <strong>adapt</strong>, <strong>make key decisions</strong>, and <strong>survive in a relentless universe</strong>.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-Astrophy</strong> combines the <strong>intensity of a rogue-like</strong> with the <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>parkour</strong> of a <strong>space platformer</strong>. <strong>Upgrade Polo</strong>, master his <strong>unique combat system</strong>, and carve your path through <strong>unknown worlds</strong> as you fight to <strong>recover your memories</strong>\u2026 and <strong>discover who unleashed this cat-astrophe</strong>.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/a95d1f84c5fcf0a3be2e089a5351191b.poster.avif?t=1757461286\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/a95d1f84c5fcf0a3be2e089a5351191b.webm?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/a95d1f84c5fcf0a3be2e089a5351191b.mp4?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Exploration:</strong> Travel through unique planets filled with secrets, procedurally generated rooms, and alternative routes that let you shape your own destiny in every run.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile, Strategic Combat:</strong> Master a real-time system where you use the <i>stellar cursor</i> to unleash attacks while controlling Polo\u2019s abilities in intense and fluid battles.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modules &amp; Reconfiguration:</strong> Transform each run with unique abilities and combinations. Discover hidden synergies and adapt your playstyle in real time to overcome any challenge.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Gather star fragments to unlock powers that persist between runs, making you stronger with each attempt.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Routes:</strong> Decide which planets to explore in every run and unlock new paths as your journey progresses.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Universe:</strong> Discover cosmic landscapes and alien creatures in modern pixel art, bursting with color, atmosphere, and personality.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enigmatic Story:</strong> Uncover the dark secrets behind Polo\u2019s abduction in a narrative full of mystery, emotion, and unexpected twists.</p></li>  </ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CHALLENGE WORTHY OF THE BOLDEST</h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat-Astrophy</strong> is a challenging rogue-lite that will test your wits and reflexes. Every run is unique: you die, you learn, you grow stronger, and you try again.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for an intense experience with exploration, innovative mechanics, and an unforgettable cosmic aesthetic\u2026 <strong>this is the challenge you\u2019ve been waiting for.</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/1785b77f5159fc341eac98558427b3d6.poster.avif?t=1757461286\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/1785b77f5159fc341eac98558427b3d6.webm?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/1785b77f5159fc341eac98558427b3d6.mp4?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/09d87bc7d658fde13f227f17b263f145.poster.avif?t=1757461286\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/09d87bc7d658fde13f227f17b263f145.webm?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/09d87bc7d658fde13f227f17b263f145.mp4?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e5037338db2b429267343914a2eef3b7.poster.avif?t=1757461286\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e5037338db2b429267343914a2eef3b7.webm?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/extras/e5037338db2b429267343914a2eef3b7.mp4?t=1757461286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>  ","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3059040?t=1757461286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757461286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059040/ead046e709191305188f231c05959ae278e9e8d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757